2.6 Building Inventory and Assets
In addition to people, structures, critical facilities and infrastructure, and other important assets in
Laramie County are potentially exposed to hazards identified in this plan.  Table 2.5 summarizes
the property inventory for the County and each participating jurisdiction, based on improvement
value (i.e. structures) and includes the building count and value grouped by parcel type and
