The Planning Commission conducts hearings for proposed development actions.  After
reviewing an application, the Planning Commission makes recommendations to the City
Council.  Seven citizens serve on the Planning Commission.  The Planning Commission assists
with the preparation of the City’s comprehensive plan, PlanCheyenne.  The Commission works
closely with the Planning and Development Department to create land development regulations.
