5% discount for those outside of the SFHA.  The Class 7 rating provides a 15% flood insurance
discount for policyholders within a SFHA and a 5% discount for those outside of the SFHA.
The vulnerability assessment in Section 4.2.6 Flood includes greater detail on flood insurance
coverage and claims for NFIP participant communities in Laramie County.
